[D] Sequence-level readout
  AP gap word: every unit has partition ((1,14)), energy 0.
  GW gap words: denominator-14 units keep one collision/missing packet in
  a small Steinhaus-energy class; global exact-M, not residues alone,
  isolates 12->24 from many residue-similar perturbations.
  Proposed sharp target:
    (1) apex-lock is a finite residue/gap-sequence filter;
    (2) every non-AP/GW apex-locked reduced row has an off-apex escape
        M(S)>1/14;
    (3) scale-separated rows need the existing analytic comb/Weyl input.
  This is a clearer form of the three-gap rigidity census, not a closure.
